(see LICENSE).


1. Origin: VPSC
---------------

EVPSC is derived from the visco-plastic self-consistent (VPSC) code
developed by R. A. Lebensohn and C. N. Tome at Los Alamos National
Laboratory (LANL). The core VPSC algorithms (Eshelby tensors,
self-consistent homogenization, hardening laws, twinning, grain shape
and texture updates, and the associated utilities) were adapted from
VPSC and extended by Y. Jeong and C. N. Tome to account for elasticity,
and by Y. Jeong, B. Jeon and C. N. Tome for the Abaqus UMAT interface.

