4. Third-party code
-------------------

src/vpsc_src/library7.sub contains numerical routines (ran2, ludcmp,
lubksb, jacobi, eigsrt, gauleg) adapted from Numerical Recipes
(W. H. Press et al., Cambridge University Press). The same routines are
part of the LANL VPSC8 release.
